---
import { ArrowRight, ShieldAlert, CheckCircle2, Sparkles } from 'lucide-react';
---

<section id="hero" class="relative pt-8 pb-20 md:pt-16 md:pb-28 overflow-hidden">
  {/* Radial Ambient Sage Glow */}
  <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[650px] h-[380px] bg-[#52b788]/10 dark:bg-[#52b788]/15 blur-[140px] rounded-full pointer-events-none -z-10" />
  <div class="absolute top-1/3 right-10 w-[400px] h-[280px] bg-[#2d6a4f]/10 dark:bg-[#1b4332]/30 blur-[120px] rounded-full pointer-events-none -z-10" />

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center space-y-6">
      {/* Status Chip */}
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#2d6a4f]/10 dark:bg-[#52b788]/15 border border-[#2d6a4f]/20 dark:border-[#52b788]/30 text-xs font-mono text-[#2d6a4f] dark:text-[#95d5b2]">
        <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
          <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-[#52b788] opacity-75"></span>
          <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-[#2d6a4f] dark:bg-[#52b788]"></span>
        </span>
        <span>AI Engineer & Full-Stack Architect &bull; Christchurch, NZ</span>
      </div>

      {/* Main Headline */}
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#12221a] dark:text-white leading-[1.08]">
        Transforming Brittle AI Loops Into <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#2d6a4f] via-[#52b788] to-[#95d5b2] dark:from-[#95d5b2] dark:via-[#52b788] dark:to-[#d8e8dc] bg-clip-text text-transparent">Deterministic Enterprise Workflows</span>.
      </h1>

      {/* Modern Problem & Solution Narrative */}
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#3b5446] dark:text-[#a3c4b2] max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Modern generative AI promises autonomy, but raw LLMs deployed into production quickly degrade into
        <strong class="text-[#12221a] dark:text-white font-bold"> token burn</strong>,
        <strong class="text-[#12221a] dark:text-white font-bold"> context drift</strong>, and
        <strong class="text-[#12221a] dark:text-white font-bold"> non-deterministic failure loops</strong>.
        I architect observable, cost-effective full-stack platforms and state-machine-driven agent systems that deliver deterministic outcomes at scale.
      </p>

      {/* Action Buttons */}
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3.5 pt-3">
        <button
          onclick="window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('open-resume-modal'))"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#1e382b] hover:bg-[#284a39] dark:bg-[#2d6a4f] dark:hover:bg-[#388261] px-6 py-3.5 text-xs font-bold text-[#f4f7f4] shadow-md transition transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0"
        >
          <span>Request Official Resume</span>
          <ArrowRight className="w-4 h-4" />
        </button>

        <a
          href="#projects"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#3b5446]/25 dark:border-[#52b788]/30 bg-white/80 dark:bg-[#102018]/80 hover:bg-[#e6eee8] dark:hover:bg-[#162d22] px-6 py-3.5 text-xs font-bold text-[#12221a] dark:text-[#f0f7f3] transition shadow-sm"
        >
          <span>Explore Architecture Deep Dives</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Hero Visual Card: Autonomous AI Coding Concept */}
    <div class="mt-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-[#3b5446]/15 dark:border-[#52b788]/20 bg-[#0e1b15] shadow-xl group">
        <img
          src="/images/ai-agent-hero.png"
          alt="Agentic AI Automation — Deterministic Tool Execution"
          class="w-full h-auto max-h-[360px] object-cover object-center opacity-90 group-hover:scale-[1.01] transition-transform duration-700"
          loading="eager"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#09130e] via-[#09130e]/40 to-transparent flex items-end p-5 sm:p-7">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between w-full gap-2">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-white text-xs font-medium">
              <span class="flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#52b788]/20 text-[#52b788]">
                <Sparkles className="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
              </span>
              <span>Agentic Coding, Tool Use & Automated Workflows</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-[#95d5b2] bg-[#1e382b]/80 border border-[#52b788]/30 px-3 py-1 rounded-full backdrop-blur-md">
              9 Years Production Engineering + Master of AI
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Modern Contrast Grid: The Industry Problem vs Architectural Reality */}
    <div class="mt-12 sm:mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      {/* Problem Card */}
      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-rose-500/20 bg-white/80 dark:bg-[#151012]/80 p-6 sm:p-8 backdrop-blur-md relative overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-rose-500/10 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 border border-rose-500/20">
            <ShieldAlert className="w-5 h-5" />
          </span>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-[#12221a] dark:text-white">The Industry Bottleneck</h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 font-mono">Uncontrolled Agent Autonomy</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#3b5446] dark:text-[#a3c4b2]">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-rose-500 font-bold mt-0.5">&times;</span>
            <span><strong>Unbounded Token Burn:</strong> Unchecked prompts and massive history dumps inflate inference budgets without improving reasoning.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-rose-500 font-bold mt-0.5">&times;</span>
            <span><strong>Context Drift & Hallucination:</strong> Agents forget core constraints after multi-turn tool calling, injecting subtle bugs into codebases.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-rose-500 font-bold mt-0.5">&times;</span>
            <span><strong>Brittle Feedback Loops:</strong> Agents hallucinating CLI outputs or spinning in circles without deterministic exit criteria.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* Solution Card */}
      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-[#52b788]/30 bg-white/90 dark:bg-[#0e1d16]/90 p-6 sm:p-8 backdrop-blur-md relative overflow-hidden shadow-sm shadow-[#2d6a4f]/10">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#52b788]/15 text-[#2d6a4f] dark:text-[#95d5b2] border border-[#52b788]/30">
            <CheckCircle2 className="w-5 h-5" />
          </span>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-[#12221a] dark:text-white">My Architectural Approach</h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#2d6a4f] dark:text-[#95d5b2] font-mono">Observable & Deterministic Systems</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#3b5446] dark:text-[#a3c4b2]">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-[#52b788] font-bold mt-0.5">&check;</span>
            <span><strong>Strict State Machine Boundaries:</strong> Deterministic transitions, typed schema gates (Zod), and sandboxed execution environments.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-[#52b788] font-bold mt-0.5">&check;</span>
            <span><strong>Context Token Optimization:</strong> Surgical file-level slicing, smart `.aiignore` filters, and aggressive prompt caching.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-[#52b788] font-bold mt-0.5">&check;</span>
            <span><strong>Automated TDD & Verifiable CI/CD:</strong> Self-healing regression test suites and containerized delivery pipelines (Docker + Caddy).</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

